WEBVTT

00:00.850 --> 00:02.490
By the way, Yuzuki.

00:02.490 --> 00:03.480
Yes?

00:03.480 --> 00:09.690
You seem rather relaxed, but wasn't your 
matchmaking meeting postponed to today?

00:10.560 --> 00:14.490
This temple's future depends on it, right?

00:14.490 --> 00:17.240
<b>Mikazuki
Temple</b>

00:14.490 --> 00:17.240
I'm going to be late!

00:17.550 --> 00:19.120
Where's the meeting?

00:19.120 --> 00:20.490
At Ryukoku Temple.

00:20.880 --> 00:26.130
We're actually supposed to move out 
of the temple as soon as possible.

00:26.460 --> 00:27.550
What?

00:27.550 --> 00:30.380
Neither of my parents live at the temple.

00:31.000 --> 00:35.630
Without a head priest, a family 
has no right to reside at a temple.

00:36.000 --> 00:40.890
But if my matchmaking meeting goes well 
and a new head priest moves in...

00:41.400 --> 00:46.150
You'd enter a marriage you don't want 
just to keep the temple open?

00:46.560 --> 00:48.650
It was my decision.

00:48.920 --> 00:51.280
I won't allow the temple to close!

00:51.280 --> 00:52.110
Bus Stop

00:56.950 --> 00:57.700
<b>Bus</b>

01:02.500 --> 01:07.820
Maybe it's impossible for me 
to keep the temple open.

01:09.890 --> 01:11.210
Yuzuki-san...

01:15.610 --> 01:17.720
This is an opportunity for you to get changed.

01:18.060 --> 01:18.970
Huh?

01:19.360 --> 01:23.020
You'll get changed now, and we'll exit 
when we hit the next red light!

01:23.020 --> 01:24.430
But...

01:24.430 --> 01:26.730
We'll borrow this truck once we're out.

01:26.730 --> 01:30.230
I have truck-driving experience, too.

01:30.690 --> 01:35.160
All right! Let's get changed 
and break down that door!

01:35.160 --> 01:36.410
Got it!

03:08.250 --> 03:16.960
Episode 4

03:08.920 --> 03:12.330
<i>And so, Akemitsu and Yuzuki 
broke through the trailer doors,</i>

03:12.330 --> 03:16.960
<i>borrowed the truck, 
and headed to Ryukoku Temple, where—</i>

03:16.960 --> 03:19.220
<b>Black Bus
Transport
Company</b>

03:17.670 --> 03:22.260
<b>Episode 4: Go Ahead and Take a Shower</b>

03:24.920 --> 03:28.470
Kiki-san, I don't want this 
temple to close after all.

03:28.470 --> 03:32.480
But it'll take three years for you 
to become the head priest.

03:32.480 --> 03:33.350
I know.

03:34.080 --> 03:36.480
And this temple has only one year left.

03:36.480 --> 03:37.530
I know.

03:38.680 --> 03:41.340
I'm going to hire a matchmaker.

03:44.990 --> 03:46.910
<b>Ryukoku
Temple</b>

03:58.990 --> 04:00.810
We made it!

04:00.810 --> 04:03.580
Um, I'm here for the matchmaking meeting!

04:03.580 --> 04:05.760
Aoba Yuzuki-san?

04:06.090 --> 04:07.300
Akagami-kun!

04:07.800 --> 04:08.640
Yes?

04:08.940 --> 04:11.180
Thank you so much for getting me this far.

04:11.180 --> 04:13.060
I'll handle the rest.

04:13.060 --> 04:14.220
Of course!

04:14.680 --> 04:17.940
There isn't a man in this world 
who wouldn't fall for you!

04:17.940 --> 04:21.320
<b>Black Bus
Transport
Company</b>

04:19.350 --> 04:21.320
What? She laughed at me?

04:24.390 --> 04:26.820
I'll see you later.

04:28.160 --> 04:29.580
Good luck.

04:30.400 --> 04:34.580
<i>This is surely goodbye.</i>

04:34.960 --> 04:40.590
<i>Since she's getting married, 
a man like me can't keep living with her.</i>

04:40.590 --> 04:44.010
Yuzuki-san, I wish you the best.

04:45.980 --> 04:46.810
Huh?

04:48.770 --> 04:50.090
Who are you?

04:50.490 --> 04:54.350
Who are <i>you</i>? And what are you doing here?

04:54.350 --> 04:56.350
What do you mean?

04:56.350 --> 04:59.360
You must be associated with the temple 
since you're wearing work clothes.

04:59.360 --> 05:01.980
So start tidying up the yard.

05:01.980 --> 05:04.740
Huh?! B-But I...

05:10.900 --> 05:13.000
My name is Aoba Yuzuki.

05:13.880 --> 05:17.420
Thank you for having me today.

05:17.420 --> 05:21.500
Thank you for making the trip here.

05:21.500 --> 05:25.260
Ryokoku Temple Third Son

05:21.500 --> 05:25.260
Kijo Hoan

05:22.520 --> 05:24.600
My name is Kijo Hoan.

05:25.560 --> 05:27.420
It's a pleasure to meet you.

05:27.420 --> 05:28.740
You're quite young.

05:29.580 --> 05:31.510
Why seek a matchmaker at your age?

05:32.280 --> 05:37.450
Because I love Mikazuki Temple 
and the people who live there.

05:37.450 --> 05:39.050
I see.

05:39.050 --> 05:41.360
You should visit sometime.

05:41.360 --> 05:44.030
I'm proud to call them my family and friends.

05:44.380 --> 05:48.790
They're warm, kind, and so dependable.

05:49.460 --> 05:52.790
I'm sure they're supporting me 
from afar right now...

05:59.160 --> 06:01.460
<i>There's one right there?!</i>

06:01.900 --> 06:03.960
<i>Is that really him or a doppelganger?</i>

06:03.960 --> 06:09.450
<i>I don't want to see Yuzuki-san 
meeting with another man!</i>

06:09.450 --> 06:15.970
<i>But... her alluring figure is a sight to behold!</i>

06:16.800 --> 06:20.700
Akagami-kun, look at me.

06:23.670 --> 06:26.120
<i>Worldly desires, begone! 
Worldly desires, begone!</i>

06:26.120 --> 06:28.360
<i>That's definitely him!</i>

06:28.360 --> 06:29.550
Is something the matter?

06:29.550 --> 06:30.660
Huh?!

06:30.660 --> 06:32.920
You must be nervous.

06:32.920 --> 06:34.240
Oh, no. Not really.

06:34.240 --> 06:39.200
It's all right. Just imagine your family 
and friends are nearby watching over you.

06:39.200 --> 06:41.790
<i>Actually, I'm anxious 
because one of them </i>is<i> here!</i>

06:41.790 --> 06:43.250
Worldly desires, begone!

06:43.250 --> 06:46.730
<i>What should I do? What was I about to say?</i>

06:47.270 --> 06:49.260
<i>Yuzuki-san is distressed.</i>

06:49.520 --> 06:52.520
<i>That's not good. My presence is 
having a negative influence on her.</i>

06:52.520 --> 06:54.260
<i>I must hide myself immediately.</i>

06:56.520 --> 06:59.800
Over here. Come here.

06:58.360 --> 07:00.770
<i>It's that nun again.</i>

07:06.020 --> 07:10.570
Th-The matchmaker has suddenly fallen 
ill and is no longer able to attend,

07:10.570 --> 07:13.910
so I, the humble Akagami, 
will be taking their place.

07:15.030 --> 07:16.190
<i>What's going on here?</i>

07:16.190 --> 07:18.910
<i>I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i>

07:20.870 --> 07:24.170
<i>I must at least play Cupid for them.</i>

07:24.460 --> 07:25.580
Well then, milady.

07:25.580 --> 07:26.860
"Milady"?

07:26.860 --> 07:28.680
Shall we get started?

07:28.680 --> 07:30.010
Uh, y-yes.

07:30.560 --> 07:31.560
Milord.

07:31.560 --> 07:32.630
"Milord"...

07:33.190 --> 07:36.510
What would you like to do on 
a date with your sweetheart?

07:36.810 --> 07:39.000
I'd like to go see a movie.

07:39.000 --> 07:43.650
I often go alone, but I'd enjoy going together.

07:44.120 --> 07:46.190
<i>The meeting's actually moving forward.</i>

07:46.020 --> 07:46.610
<b>Relieved</b>

07:46.190 --> 07:48.070
<i>Maybe I don't need to be worried.</i>

07:48.070 --> 07:50.470
<i>A movie?!</i>

07:51.070 --> 07:54.380
<i>A movie theater... Couples' seating...</i>

07:54.380 --> 07:56.320
<i>Under cover of darkness...</i>

07:56.320 --> 07:58.080
This is embarrassing.

08:00.040 --> 08:02.080
<i>You look like an Asura, Akagami-kun!</i>

08:02.430 --> 08:04.330
<i>No, no. I'm Cupid.</i>

08:05.120 --> 08:08.270
How do you spend your days off?

08:08.270 --> 08:10.590
I spend them relaxing at hot springs.

08:10.920 --> 08:12.590
<i>Hot springs?!</i>

08:16.420 --> 08:18.120
Allow me to join you.

08:20.600 --> 08:23.070
Akagami-kun, are you okay?

08:23.070 --> 08:27.110
Don't worry about me. In that case, milord...

08:27.620 --> 08:29.860
What if you were to get married?

08:30.220 --> 08:32.860
I'd like to have about ten kids.

08:35.650 --> 08:38.870
I want your babies.

08:39.310 --> 08:41.620
Akagami-kun!

08:46.880 --> 08:49.960
Um, I'm sorry about that.

08:49.960 --> 08:52.880
It's fine. Your friends really 
are exactly as you described.

08:53.320 --> 08:54.510
Huh?

08:54.510 --> 08:56.980
I don't know what he was doing here,

08:57.560 --> 09:00.510
but I'm certain he didn't come 
to interfere with our meeting.

09:00.860 --> 09:04.520
I consider myself an excellent 
judge of character.

09:04.960 --> 09:08.060
He must've been genuinely worried about you.

09:08.590 --> 09:11.530
There wasn't a single lie 
in anything he said or did.

09:12.370 --> 09:13.480
<i>Lies...</i>

09:15.000 --> 09:19.100
Listen to me, Yuzuki. You mustn't lie.

09:20.340 --> 09:23.270
<i>That's right. Lying is wrong.</i>

09:24.380 --> 09:25.610
Is something the matter?

09:26.060 --> 09:28.540
Kijo-san, I'm sorry.

09:28.880 --> 09:33.550
I don't actually intend to get married.

09:34.180 --> 09:38.980
So you'll have a man qualified to serve as 
a head priest take over Mikazuki Temple.

09:39.470 --> 09:40.140
Yes.

09:40.140 --> 09:42.060
And that's why you're hiring a matchmaker?

09:42.060 --> 09:45.430
I know it isn't the noblest of motives.

09:45.430 --> 09:48.940
Sounds fine to me. After all, 
you'll be meeting Buddhist priests.

09:49.390 --> 09:50.270
Huh?

09:51.860 --> 09:54.530
You can just go through the 
motions of attending a meeting.

09:54.810 --> 09:55.820
But...

09:55.820 --> 09:59.770
You're basically buying time 
until you become a nun, right?

09:56.030 --> 10:03.790
Temple

09:59.770 --> 10:03.790
Then just get engaged and 
break it off in three years.

10:04.660 --> 10:06.660
Doesn't that sound like a scam?

10:06.660 --> 10:08.250
What are you talking about?

10:08.250 --> 10:11.420
He'll get the chance to dream of 
marrying a beautiful young woman.

10:11.420 --> 10:12.920
That's totally a scam.

10:13.260 --> 10:17.010
If you really like him, 
then you can get married.

10:17.010 --> 10:19.580
What if he wants to get married sooner?

10:19.580 --> 10:24.930
Tell him you want to focus on your studies 
a little longer and have him wait.

10:26.400 --> 10:28.570
Okay. I'll give it a shot.

10:28.990 --> 10:30.810
Good, that's the spirit.

10:31.550 --> 10:35.690
Show some unmarried 
reject priest a fleeting dream.

10:35.690 --> 10:38.300
Kiki-san, what do you have against priests?

10:40.150 --> 10:41.070
I see.

10:41.360 --> 10:46.010
In other words, you wanted help 
keeping your temple open.

10:46.010 --> 10:47.080
Yes.

10:47.560 --> 10:50.330
And that's why you hired a matchmaker.

10:50.330 --> 10:54.090
I'm really sorry. I realized I shouldn't lie.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.100
Still...

10:56.940 --> 10:59.630
I know this is insolent of me, but please...

10:59.630 --> 11:01.840
Would you be willing to get engaged?

11:02.630 --> 11:05.800
Please give me—give us some time.

11:06.730 --> 11:11.350
You're a straightforward person. I like that.

11:12.100 --> 11:13.360
But you're a child.

11:14.800 --> 11:20.270
I hear Mikazuki Temple is 
perpetually broke and understaffed.

11:20.270 --> 11:23.870
And the main temple is in 
desperate need of repairs.

11:23.870 --> 11:25.200
I...

11:25.200 --> 11:28.510
Can you satisfy your parishioners like that?

11:28.510 --> 11:32.140
Can you save others when you 
can't even take care of yourself?

11:32.870 --> 11:37.390
Keeping the temple open 
won't make anyone happy.

11:37.870 --> 11:41.640
I'm sure whoever decided to shut 
it down had the same thought.

11:43.920 --> 11:45.140
No one?

11:46.570 --> 11:48.930
But they're...

11:48.930 --> 11:50.860
Wake up and smell the coffee.

11:53.290 --> 11:56.040
Mikazuki Temple isn't worth protecting.

11:57.440 --> 12:00.760
Still, I will take over the temple!

12:02.120 --> 12:06.910
I had no idea my debt had 
made the situation so terrible.

12:06.910 --> 12:11.610
The least I can do is give my life 
to restore Mikazuki Temple's image!

12:11.610 --> 12:14.040
That would only hurt our 
image more, Akagami-kun!

12:14.690 --> 12:18.950
Milord, is there any way we can have 
a second chance at this meeting?

12:20.050 --> 12:22.520
Akagami-san, was it?

12:23.080 --> 12:26.550
Shutting the temple down 
should be in your best interest, too.

12:26.550 --> 12:27.790
Huh?

12:27.790 --> 12:30.270
You could slowly pay off your debt.

12:30.270 --> 12:33.560
Once the temple is gone, 
you won't have to serve them.

12:33.560 --> 12:36.860
<i>Oh, right. It's good for Akagami-kun, too.</i>

12:37.880 --> 12:41.070
I do believe that concludes our meeting.

12:44.000 --> 12:47.040
Listen, nobody needs Mikazuki Temple any—

12:47.040 --> 12:51.660
That temple and Yuzuki-san have saved me twice.

12:51.660 --> 12:53.160
Akagami-kun...

12:53.810 --> 12:57.590
That temple isn't worthless.

12:58.710 --> 13:00.600
You think it should stay open?

13:01.280 --> 13:02.300
Yes.

13:02.300 --> 13:05.800
Even if Yuzuki-san suffers because of it?

13:06.500 --> 13:09.130
Running a temple is hardly easy.

13:09.130 --> 13:10.510
She won't be the only one.

13:10.510 --> 13:12.810
Her family and parishioners 
will suffer, as well.

13:12.810 --> 13:15.810
What if she fails? What if things get worse?

13:15.810 --> 13:19.190
What will you do when 
she can't take it anymore?

13:20.400 --> 13:22.070
I'll support her.

13:24.820 --> 13:27.820
Oh? Do you swear it?

13:27.820 --> 13:32.080
You'll spend the rest of your life 
making Aoba Yuzuki-san happy?

13:32.410 --> 13:33.480
I will!

13:34.400 --> 13:37.790
You'll remain with her 
in sickness and in health?

13:37.790 --> 13:38.330
What?!

13:38.670 --> 13:39.530
I will!

13:39.530 --> 13:40.590
Hey, wait...

13:41.640 --> 13:46.030
You'll care for one another and build 
a bright and happy family together?

13:46.030 --> 13:47.310
I will!

13:46.570 --> 13:48.840
Is this... a propo—

13:49.830 --> 13:53.850
Then demonstrate the worth 
of Mikazuki Temple.

13:54.270 --> 13:59.280
Show me that the ideals of children 
can overcome the harshness of reality.

14:01.040 --> 14:03.730
Now then, Aoba Yuzuki-san.

14:04.390 --> 14:05.240
Yes?

14:05.940 --> 14:08.300
I accept your engagement proposal.

14:08.300 --> 14:09.110
What?!

14:09.420 --> 14:12.600
But I'm only lending you my name.

14:15.000 --> 14:16.870
Thank you!

14:22.130 --> 14:28.130
Hoan, I thought I told you to 
convince her to shut down the temple.

14:28.480 --> 14:31.140
She brought an interesting boy along, 
and I couldn't help myself.

14:31.620 --> 14:34.210
Weren't you curious about him, too?

14:34.210 --> 14:36.390
That's why you involved him in the meeting.

14:36.950 --> 14:39.900
Isn't that right, High Priest Aoba?

14:40.230 --> 14:41.700
Akagami...

14:42.430 --> 14:44.740
He's that man's son, huh?

14:46.230 --> 14:49.910
<b>A contented mind is a perpetual feast.</b>

14:50.930 --> 14:53.130
Too bad we missed the last bus.

14:54.950 --> 14:57.160
We'll walk to the station.

14:58.190 --> 14:59.960
I'm sorry for everything.

14:59.960 --> 15:01.290
What do you mean?

15:01.290 --> 15:02.520
Nothing.

15:02.520 --> 15:05.920
Either way, I'm glad the 
matchmaking meeting went well.

15:06.580 --> 15:10.020
So you're getting engaged in 
name only, but won't marry...

15:10.680 --> 15:14.430
Does that mean I don't have 
to move out of the temple?!

15:14.430 --> 15:16.180
Of course.

15:16.180 --> 15:20.940
Yahoo! All right! Yes!

15:22.830 --> 15:24.840
Yahoo!

15:28.690 --> 15:30.810
Y-Yuzuki-san?!

15:30.810 --> 15:35.200
Sorry! I'm not sure what 
my face looks like right now.

15:35.200 --> 15:37.820
Thank you, Akagami-kun.

15:40.830 --> 15:42.700
You're crying and blushing at the same time!

15:42.700 --> 15:44.960
Why did you have to look?!

15:45.510 --> 15:46.970
Are you feeling unwell?

15:46.970 --> 15:50.720
No, you idiot!

15:50.720 --> 15:52.470
Platform 2

15:50.720 --> 15:52.470
Train service has ended for the day

15:52.750 --> 15:55.970
<i>The last train has departed from the station.</i>

15:56.410 --> 15:58.910
<i>The exits will be closed shortly.</i>

15:58.910 --> 16:04.300
<i>Please leave the station immediately.</i>

16:07.890 --> 16:08.680
We'll get a taxi.

16:08.680 --> 16:09.860
Good idea!

16:09.990 --> 16:12.710
There aren't any here!

16:13.990 --> 16:17.990
I don't see any cars, and my phone's dead.

16:17.990 --> 16:19.740
What about yours?

16:20.450 --> 16:22.190
Mine was crushed.

16:22.190 --> 16:23.750
What happened?!

16:24.370 --> 16:26.650
What are we going to do? It's getting cold.

16:27.050 --> 16:27.750
Ow!

16:28.740 --> 16:30.170
A blister...

16:31.070 --> 16:34.510
That's not good. We'll have to rest somewhere.

16:37.140 --> 16:40.520
Silk Road ~Beyond Nirvana~

16:43.580 --> 16:45.190
No, no, no.

16:46.400 --> 16:51.310
<i>She's not seducing you. This is definitely 
not a come-on, Akagami Akemitsu.</i>

16:51.310 --> 16:54.540
<i>Begone, worldly desires!</i>

16:54.540 --> 16:55.820
Akagami-kun.

16:57.330 --> 16:58.860
Should we check it out?

16:58.860 --> 17:00.410
<i>Yuzuki-san?!</i>

17:00.410 --> 17:08.040
Silk Road ~Beyond Nirvana~

17:01.430 --> 17:03.820
How can you be so casual about it?!

17:03.820 --> 17:05.820
I don't mean in a weird way.

17:05.820 --> 17:08.040
But you know, there's nothing else around.

17:08.040 --> 17:09.920
That's not the problem here!

17:09.920 --> 17:13.420
A young man and woman shouldn't 
casually enter a love hotel together!

17:11.170 --> 17:11.460
<b>Room 205</b>

17:11.170 --> 17:11.590
<b>Stay</b>

17:11.170 --> 17:11.940
<b>Rest</b>

17:15.110 --> 17:18.680
<i>We checked in!</i>

17:19.040 --> 17:20.680
Wow!

17:20.680 --> 17:22.810
Isn't this place amazing, Akagami-kun?

17:22.810 --> 17:24.060
It sure is.

17:24.060 --> 17:26.650
And it's way cleaner than I expected.

17:26.650 --> 17:27.900
It sure is.

17:28.280 --> 17:30.380
Looks like we can order food, too.

17:30.380 --> 17:32.590
<i>Great attitude, Yuzuki-san.</i>

17:32.590 --> 17:35.400
<i>There's no way things will get awkward now.</i>

17:35.400 --> 17:38.250
They've even got karaoke and games.

17:38.250 --> 17:41.160
<i>As long as I don't look at that wall...</i>

17:41.160 --> 17:43.050
Akagami-kun, look.

17:43.540 --> 17:45.830
<b>Cosplay Costumes for Rent</b>

17:43.540 --> 17:45.830
<b>Free!!</b>

17:43.840 --> 17:45.830
They've got cosplay costumes.

17:46.120 --> 17:48.540
<b>Cosplay Costumes for Rent</b>

17:47.410 --> 17:48.540
<i>Yuzuki-san!</i>

17:48.910 --> 17:53.380
<i>Wh-Why? Why must you 
provoke my worldly desires?!</i>

17:54.550 --> 17:58.540
<i>Calm down. Yuzuki-san's 
doing this to ease the tension.</i>

17:58.540 --> 18:00.170
They've got movies, too.

18:00.170 --> 18:01.810
We can watch all the AVs we want.

18:01.810 --> 18:03.810
Worldly desires, begone!

18:03.810 --> 18:07.080
Oh, sorry. I got carried away.

18:03.890 --> 18:08.310
<b>Worldy
Desires Begone...</b>

18:07.080 --> 18:08.310
It's fine.

18:24.880 --> 18:25.930
Akagami-kun...

18:25.930 --> 18:27.080
Y-Yes?

18:27.360 --> 18:29.580
Go ahead and take a shower.

18:29.580 --> 18:32.590
<i>She's totally down!</i>

18:35.340 --> 18:37.930
<i>No, don't be ridiculous.</i>

18:37.930 --> 18:40.090
<i>There's no way Yuzuki-san 
would try to seduce me.</i>

18:43.340 --> 18:46.600
<i>She considerately suggested I bathe 
because she knows I'm exhausted.</i>

18:49.930 --> 18:53.110
<i>That's right. It wasn't for 
any inappropriate reason.</i>

18:55.230 --> 18:57.280
Yuzuki-san, I'm out of the—

18:59.190 --> 19:00.710
Is something the matter?

19:01.200 --> 19:02.060
No.

19:04.080 --> 19:05.280
I'm going to take a bath.

19:05.280 --> 19:06.840
O-Okay.

19:15.460 --> 19:18.810
<i>Y-Yuzuki-san was watching an AV?</i>

19:20.470 --> 19:23.000
<i>Hang on! Surely she didn't 
have me take a bath first</i>

19:23.000 --> 19:26.380
<i>because she wanted to secretly watch an AV!</i>

19:25.970 --> 19:32.480
<b>Correct</b>

19:26.380 --> 19:28.430
That's correct, Akagami-san.

19:28.430 --> 19:30.400
Yuzuki-oneechan is a perv, too.

19:30.400 --> 19:32.480
The quiet type.

19:32.920 --> 19:35.730
<i>What am I supposed to do here?!</i>

19:35.730 --> 19:37.980
What's there to think about?

19:37.980 --> 19:40.240
<b>Akagami Perv-mitsu</b>

19:37.980 --> 19:40.240
Pinning her down is the only choice!

19:40.240 --> 19:43.110
<b>Dummy-gami Akemitsu</b>

19:40.590 --> 19:43.110
Isn't that what she's hoping you'll do?

19:43.110 --> 19:45.740
Show her the kind of man you are!

19:45.740 --> 19:49.120
You musn't embarrass a woman.

19:49.120 --> 19:52.290
<i>Why do they have to agree with each other?</i>

19:52.730 --> 19:54.320
C'mon, be honest with yourself.

19:54.320 --> 19:56.240
Don't you want to get with her, too?

19:56.240 --> 19:59.450
Stop!

19:59.450 --> 20:02.340
Wait, violence is wrong.

20:02.340 --> 20:04.800
Let's climb the stairs of adulthood together.

20:04.800 --> 20:07.100
Damn it!

20:08.710 --> 20:11.540
<i>I swore I'd support her.</i>

20:13.720 --> 20:18.730
I'll protect her from myself!

20:22.560 --> 20:25.400
Wow, so that's what AVs are like.

20:29.600 --> 20:32.160
This bath is huge.

20:32.160 --> 20:35.000
What's this for?

20:35.000 --> 20:38.240
I can't believe I actually 
entered a love hotel.

20:38.240 --> 20:40.630
What should I do? What am I supposed to do?

20:41.160 --> 20:43.480
I'll start by warming up and calming down.

20:48.560 --> 20:52.390
<i>Now that I've calmed down,
I'm so embarrassed!</i>

20:52.770 --> 20:55.160
Why did I act so excited?!

20:55.160 --> 20:59.360
By bringing him here, I made it seem 
like I'm hoping something will happen!

21:00.390 --> 21:03.570
We're going to have a 
misunderstanding, aren't we?

21:03.570 --> 21:06.840
Akagami-kun and I are about to...

21:09.200 --> 21:10.680
I'll support her.

21:14.790 --> 21:15.670
I will!

21:25.080 --> 21:33.290
<i>If Akagami-kun really wants me, then I...</i>

21:41.680 --> 21:42.520
What?

21:44.980 --> 21:46.740
Don't worry.

21:47.120 --> 21:50.740
No harm will come to you now, Yuzuki-san.

21:52.400 --> 21:54.890
You can rest at ease.

21:57.290 --> 22:00.000
Yuzuki-san, why did you blindfold me?

22:00.400 --> 22:04.140
Yuzuki-san? Hey, Yuzuki-san...

22:06.310 --> 22:08.970
How am I supposed to use the bathroom?

22:09.350 --> 22:12.830
Yuzuki-san? You're there, aren't you?

22:09.700 --> 22:14.970
Silk Road ~Beyond Nirvana~

22:12.830 --> 22:13.760
Dummy.

22:13.760 --> 22:14.970
Hey!

23:44.940 --> 23:59.950
<b>Next Time

How Shall I Make
You Take Responsibility?</b>

23:45.540 --> 23:47.520
Bullseye.

23:47.520 --> 23:48.380
Oh?

23:48.380 --> 23:50.320
Finally got it.

23:50.320 --> 23:51.460
Ah, I see.

23:52.500 --> 23:54.320
You're talking about archery, right?

23:54.320 --> 23:56.200
Aw, come on.

23:56.200 --> 23:57.750
You're too desperate to make it happen.
